    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d350">

                <pb facs="0470" n="460" sameAs="frus:frus1942China/pg460"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/7416a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Gauss</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-02-12">February 12,
                        1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>92. Please deliver the following personal message from the President to His
                    Excellency Generalissimo Chiang Kai-shek: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“I have this moment signed the bill appropriating five hundred million
                            dollars to render financial aid to China<anchor n="85" xml:id="d350-f1"
                            /> and it is now law. Franklin D. Roosevelt.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
